# Colocation Rules: SHARE|SUBPATH|DEPTH
# Depth 0 = whole SUBPATH on one disk
# Depth 1 = each immediate subfolder on its own disk

# data|backups|0
# data|photos|0
# data|torrents|0
# data|usenet|0
# data|media/audiobooks|0
# data|media/books|0
# data|media/music|0
# data|media/podcasts|0
# data|media/movies|1
# data|media/tv|1
